                                <h2 id="auth-POSTapi-logout">Logout

Terminates the user&#039;s active session by deleting all authentication tokens and logging out from the web guard. 
This endpoint should be called when a user wants to securely log out of the application.</h2>

<p>
</p>



<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-logout">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
